### Fix create_udf Examples in DataFusion

Source: https://github.com/apache/datafusion/blob/main/dev/changelog/46.0.0.md

This snippet addresses issues found in the examples for creating User Defined Functions (UDFs). Ensure correct usage and syntax when defining custom functions.

