### Query Delta Table with DataFusion DataFrame API (Rust)

Source: https://github.com/delta-io/delta-rs/blob/main/docs/usage/querying-delta-tables.md

Query a Delta table using Apache DataFusion's DataFrame API in Rust. This provides a programmatic way to build queries. Requires `deltalake` and `datafusion`.

```rust
use url::Url;
use deltalake::open_table;
use datafusion::prelude::SessionContext;
use datafusion::logical_expr::{col, lit};

let delta_path = Url::from_directory_path("/rust/tests/data/delta-0.8.0-partitioned").unwrap();
let table = open_table(delta_path).await?;
let ctx = SessionContext::new();
let dataframe = ctx.read_table(table.table_provider().await?)?;
let df = dataframe.filter(col("year").eq(lit(2021)))?.select(vec![col("value")])?;
df.show().await?;
```

